            <description><![CDATA[<h2>App Inspector 0.3.0</h2>
<p>App Inspector can now lock its windows behind Touch ID or your Mac login password.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Turn on the lock in <strong>Settings → Security</strong> and choose when it relocks after inactivity.</li>
  <li>Press <strong>⌃⌘L</strong> to lock it immediately. App Inspector also locks when the Mac sleeps or the screen locks.</li>
  <li>Scans keep running while the app is locked.</li>
</ul>
<p>Requires macOS 15 Sequoia or later.</p>
]]></description>
